00:00:11.937 --> 00:00:16.448
From Anthropic Newsroom, published November 18, 2026.

4
00:00:17.448 --> 00:00:48.226
Today Anthropic, P B C priced its initial public offering of its Class A common stock at 83.00 dollarsper share. The offering consists of 980000000 shares of Class A common stock, 956351354 of which are being sold by Anthropic and 23648646 of which are being sold by certain selling stockholders.

5
00:00:48.346 --> 00:00:53.615
Anthropic will not receive any proceeds from the sale of shares by the selling stockholders.

6
00:00:54.065 --> 00:01:11.873
The shares are expected to begin trading on the Nasdaq Global Select Market on November 19, 2026 under the symbol “ANT.” The offering is expected to close on November 20, 2026, subject to the satisfaction of customary closing conditions.

7
00:01:11.993 --> 00:01:22.382
In addition, Anthropic has granted the underwriters a 30-day option to purchase up to an additional 147000000 shares of its Class A common stock.

8
00:01:22.832 --> 00:01:42.480
A registration statement relating to these securities was declared effective by the Securities and Exchange Commission on November 18, 2026. The offering is being made only by means of a prospectus. Copies of the final prospectus may be obtained, when available, from: Goldman Sachs and Co.

9
00:01:42.600 --> 00:02:14.944
LLC, Attention: Prospectus Department, 200 West Street, New York, NY 10282, by telephone at (866) 471 to 2526, or by email at prospectus-ny@ny.email.gs.com; or Morgan Stanley and Co. LLC, Attention: Prospectus Department, 180 Varick Street, 2nd Floor, New York, NY 10014, or by email at prospectus@morganstanley.com.

